{
 "note": "measurement rules per template for extraction/measure_sections.mjs (rendered-DOM selectors are evidence tooling only; no contract field depends on them). Rule kinds: sel (each match = node), union (all matches = one node), split (chapters bounded by headings), groups (children separated by spacer children), years (listing rows grouped by year), virtual (overlay without page height).",
